OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight resurfacing to shut A6
OL,4,Ain #1.9m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvernight road closures for resurfacing
OL,7,Fwork are due to start as part of a
OL,8,F#1.9m scheme to improve safety and
OL,9,Ftraffic flow in Oadby.
OL,11,FLeicestershire County Council aims to
OL,12,Fimprove and upgrade "busy transport
OL,13,Fhotspots" along the A6, centred at The
OL,14,FParade and Brabazon Road junctions.
OL,16,FOn Monday, the A6 between Asda and New
OL,17,FStreet will shut from 20:00 and 06:00
OL,18,FGMT during weekdays until 27 November
OL,19,Ffor resurfacing work to be carried out,
OL,20,Fwith diversions in place.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
