OL,3,GNEWSAOvernight resurfacing to shut A6
OL,4,Ain #1.9m upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK-run authority said major
OL,7,Fimprovements to the road included new
OL,8,Fand upgraded pedestrian and cycle
OL,9,Fcrossings, raised crossings, footway
OL,10,Fimprovements and new traffic signal
OL,11,Fequipment.
